 969:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_timer.c **** /*!
 970:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_timer.c ****     \brief      configure TIMER channel output compare mode
 971:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_timer.c ****     \param[in]  timer_periph: please refer to the following parameters
 972:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_timer.c ****     \param[in]  channel:
 973:../Firmware/GD32E23x_standard_peripheral/Source/gd32e23x_timer.c ****                 only one parameter can be selected which is shown as below:
